---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout 
  title="Blog"
  description="Technical articles and insights from Nitesh Sharma on distributed systems, microservices architecture, and workflow orchestration."
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 min-h-[70vh]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Blog</h1>
        
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-50 to-blue-50 dark:from-accent-900/20 dark:to-blue-900/20 rounded-lg p-12 mb-8">
          <svg class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-6 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z" />
          </svg>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Coming Soon</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
            I'm working on sharing insights and lessons learned from architecting distributed systems, event-driven microservices, and workflow orchestration platforms.
          </p>
          
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/50 rounded-lg p-6 text-left">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Planned Topics</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Building resilient DAG-based workflow orchestration systems</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Event-driven architecture patterns with Kafka and RabbitMQ</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Testing strategies for distributed microservices</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                <span>API contract management with OpenAPI and Zod</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Lessons from architecting government digital platforms</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <p class="mb-6">
            In the meantime, feel free to connect with me to discuss distributed systems, microservices architecture, and technical leadership.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
            <a
              href="/nitesh-portfolio/contact"
              class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent-600 hover:bg-accent-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              Get in Touch
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nitesh-sharma-90035491/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
              </svg>
              Connect on LinkedIn
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
